                            <comment id="17056962" author="prabhjyotsingh" created="Wed, 11 Mar 2020 12:40:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have cloned this from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4377&quot; title=&quot;Interpreter doesn&amp;#39;t start if interpreter ID contains space&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-4377&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-4377&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, I believe this should have fix in the backend as well.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17056964" author="alexott" created="Wed, 11 Mar 2020 12:43:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;it should be fixed in backend/scripts as well: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3482/files&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3482/files&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17056989" author="prabhjyotsingh" created="Wed, 11 Mar 2020 13:18:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;If I call up API directly, then it is still possible.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
curl &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;http:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//localhost:8080/api/interpreter/setting&apos;&lt;/span&gt; -H &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8&apos;&lt;/span&gt; --data-binary &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;{&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;name&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;test space&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;group&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;angular&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;properties&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:{},&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;dependencies&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:[],&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;option&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:{&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;remote&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;isExistingProcess&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;setPermission&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;session&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;process&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;perNote&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;shared&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;perUser&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;shared&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;owners&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:[]},&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;propertyValue&quot;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;,&quot;&lt;/span&gt;propertyKey&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;,&quot;&lt;/span&gt;propertyType&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&lt;/span&gt;textarea&quot;}&apos;&lt;/span&gt; --compressed&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;May be it won&apos;t let me run, but it will still allow me to create that interpreter.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
